WEBVTT

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:37.070
This is the piece I promised you
in return for your help with Ubertino.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:40.650
Oh, I'm so happy! I've been waiting
for this for a long time.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:44.280
Speaking of which, I heard the other
guild members accepted you.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:49.110
Yes, thanks. I was able to become friends
with the other apprentices, too.

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:51.280
I see. I'm glad.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:54.690
I'm looking forward to your future
more and more, Arte.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:41.070
Goodness, must you always come without warning?

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:44.760
"The Venetian Noble"

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:44.730
Impatient men without enough
consideration for others will be hated.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:47.440
Oh, is that right? That's not good.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:51.860
Well then, I'll be careful next time
so I won't be hated by the woman I love.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:53.780
Oh, my.

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:55.480
Is this your portrait?

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:59.570
Yes. It's by someone I'm proud to call a friend.

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:03.360
She's really unusual--a female apprentice.

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:09.900
Thanks. Even though we just me the other day,
you're teaching me how to read and write.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.070
But that Veronica you were talking about...

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.110
Books are expensive,
so for her to have so many,

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:16.900
just what kind of person is she?

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:19.730
Oh, Veronica's a high-class prostitute.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:24.480
Prosti-- Pr-Pr-Prostitute?!

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:25.980
Hey, you!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:29.030
So you're the female apprentice
everyone's talking about!

00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:33.980
I'm honored to meet you, future female painter.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.820
Huh? U-Um...

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:40.980
The Falier family?

00:03:40.980 --> 00:03:43.230
The famous noble family from Venice?

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:45.320
Yes, <i>that</i> Falier.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:49.280
If you've heard of my family,
then it makes my self-introduction easier.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.650
I'm Yuri.

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:56.690
So, what business does a Venetian noble
have with a small workshop like mine?

00:03:56.690 --> 00:04:01.190
Business? Right, let me
get straight to the point.

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:06.980
I want your apprentice, Arte,
to come work for me in Venice.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:13.190
Are you asking me to let my apprentice
go to Venice by herself?

00:04:13.190 --> 00:04:18.780
Yes. I'm saying that I'd like her to take
this job as a painter in her own right.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.650
There are two parts to this job:

00:04:20.650 --> 00:04:24.610
First, I'd like her to work as the portrait
painter for the Falier family.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:31.860
Second--and this is what I really want her for--
I want her to be my niece's tutor.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:33.150
Tutor?

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:37.650
Yes. My niece is very independent,
if you're putting it nicely.

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:42.650
If you're not, well, she's stubborn
and kind of selfish.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:47.690
All the tutors she's had up until now
have thrown up their hands and quit.

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:51.780
So, I'm looking for a tutor that will suit her.

00:04:51.780 --> 00:04:54.820
Um, why me?

00:04:54.820 --> 00:05:03.400
Of course, I saw your work and liked
the uniquely soft touch you have.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.860
But more importantly, the main
reason I want you specifically

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:10.400
is because you're a woman
and from a noble family.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:15.650
I hope you will take this job.

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:18.320
You probably want time to think this over.

00:05:18.320 --> 00:05:21.190
I'll go home for today.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:23.940
I look forward to a favorable response.

00:05:28.190 --> 00:05:31.190
Arte? Hey, Arte!

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:33.860
Don't stare off into space.
It's time to start work.

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:35.980
Yes, sir! I'm sorry!

00:05:38.110 --> 00:05:41.900
I have to work... work...

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:44.190
...the main reason I want you specifically

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.610
is because you're a woman
and from a noble family.

00:05:48.940 --> 00:05:53.070
It's watery. This has way too little flavor.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.320
Or is your stomach not feeling well?

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.150
I'm sorry.

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.570
Is it about the offer from this afternoon?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:04.030
U-Um, I couldn't stop thinking about it.

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.820
What should I do?

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:12.400
It's an offer that's for you personally.
I don't have any right to say anything about it.

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:18.320
Besides, for a mere apprentice
to suddenly get such a big job...

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.570
I've never heard of anything
like this happening before.

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:27.190
I really shouldn't be hesitating
to say yes to my good luck, huh?

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:32.480
Don't think about it in terms
of good or bad luck.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:38.570
There are many who think talent and luck are
required to make a living in this profession,

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.780
but we're artisans.

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:42.730
I was always told that if I practiced enough,

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:46.820
then I would become skilled
enough to make a living.

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:49.230
I still believe this.

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:55.440
If you become truly skilled, then you'll
have more than one chance to get work.

00:06:55.440 --> 00:07:00.980
No matter what you decide,
I'll respect your decision.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:02.360
Thanks.

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:17.320
Arte!

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.320
Hey, Arte!

00:07:20.820 --> 00:07:23.150
All right, I've decided!

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:25.940
Huh? Darcia?

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:29.070
Please excuse me for coming
out of the blue, Lord Yuri.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:32.070
I wanted to respond to your
request from the other day.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.150
Well, let me hear it.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:37.900
I've been thinking about it this whole time.

00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:39.780
"Because I'm a woman and a noble."

00:07:39.780 --> 00:07:45.110
Those reasons have been such huge
obstacles for me up until now.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:49.320
When I heard those words, I felt rebellious.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:54.480
That's why it took so long for me
to be able to think about it calmly.

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:57.860
But I've finally been able
to put my thoughts in order.

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:02.400
Please allow me... to refuse this offer.

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:05.900
I still have much to learn and practice.

00:08:05.900 --> 00:08:07.900
When I have amassed enough skill

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:12.730
and believe I will be able
to satisfy my customers,

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:16.780
that's when I think I
should be looking for work.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:20.360
That's why I'm sorry,
but I must refuse this time.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:22.650
Is that right? I'm sorry to hear that.

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:25.190
Well then, please excuse me.

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:34.110
Setting aside work, I hope you'll come
to me if you every need anything.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.690
My door is always open for you.

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:39.320
Thank you!

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:44.650
Ah, I feel like a small bone that's been
stuck in my throat is finally out!

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:48.070
My heart and body both feel light!

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:49.400
Um--

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:53.150
Excuse me, I'd like to ask for directions...

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:56.150
Oh! Your stomach's so big...

00:08:57.190 --> 00:09:03.980
I've been waiting expectantly for this child
to be born. I've gotten so big, my back hurts.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.030
I've come to visit an old friend
I haven't seen in ten years,

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:08.820
but I can't find his house.

00:09:08.820 --> 00:09:12.690
Is it around here? If you'd like,
I can help you look!

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:18.440
Really? That'd be great.
I think he runs a small workshop...

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:22.280
I don't think he's very famous,
but I wonder if you've heard of him.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:26.230
His name's Leo, and he's a painter.

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:27.940
Leo?

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.780
Huh? Apprentice?

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:34.690
Yeah. It might be unusual to have a female
apprentice, but a lot happened.

00:09:34.690 --> 00:09:36.360
She's been with me for a while now.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:41.110
<i>You</i> ? Have an <i>apprentice</i> ?
And she's from a noble family?

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:45.110
There's so much to say,
I don't know where to start.

00:09:45.110 --> 00:09:48.860
I'm Ruthanna! He and I are old friends.

00:09:48.860 --> 00:09:53.570
You're rushing on ahead, as usual.
My apprentice is confused.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:56.860
Leo had friends?

00:09:59.940 --> 00:10:01.940
As expected of Leo's apprentice!

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:04.530
He doesn't seem like he'd
have any friends, right?

00:10:04.530 --> 00:10:06.480
It's true! You're not wrong!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:08.190
Hey.

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:11.320
You've been living out in Siena, right?

00:10:11.320 --> 00:10:14.070
What about your husband? He's not with you?

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.780
Husband? My husband didn't come.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:21.150
He didn't come? Then, you came alone...?

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:23.780
That's right. I came alone.

00:10:26.110 --> 00:10:31.070
Arte, I need to talk to Ruthanna
alone. Will you leave us?

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:37.530
It's my first time seeing someone

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:44.070
who's not a customer talk to Leo
in such a friendly and fun way...

00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:48.070
I can't believe you have such a cute apprentice.

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:52.530
This guy never jokes around
and is really boring, isn't he?

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:54.070
Hey.

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:58.070
See you later, Leo. I'm glad
I got to see you after so long.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:09.280
Ruthanna! If there's anything
I can help you with, tell me!

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:16.150
I will. Thanks, Leo.

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:21.730
I've known Ruthanna for a long time.

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:25.320
She's the only daughter... of my master.

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:27.940
R-Really...?

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.730
Arte! Wait up!

00:11:36.480 --> 00:11:40.780
All my seamstress friends have been
talking about that Ruthanna!

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:45.730
She's originally from here, but she moved
to Siena after getting married.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:48.690
But recently, her husband passed away.

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:52.730
Huh? She didn't look like something
like that had happened.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:59.610
And her husband's family won't return the
large dowry she had when she got married.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.480
She's come back to negotiate
the return of that money.

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:08.980
Isn't a dowry returned to the woman
if she becomes widowed?

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:11.440
Well, it's supposed to be.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:13.730
So, what about her?

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:16.940
She seems to be really close to Leo,

00:12:16.940 --> 00:12:19.980
so I was wondering if there
was anything I could do...

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:30.570
Please! Please return the precious
dowry my father paid you.

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:34.570
I need money for this child in my
stomach, and also so I can live.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:37.230
You just won't give up, will you?

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:41.570
The money I returned was all of it!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:44.320
I told you, didn't I? I can't
give you what I don't have!

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:49.940
If I give you more, then we'll go bankrupt.
Who do you think you are, anyway?

00:12:52.610 --> 00:12:54.030
Um...

00:12:55.230 --> 00:12:56.690
Are you all right?

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:58.400
You...

00:13:01.320 --> 00:13:03.030
Ruthanna!

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:10.150
Thank you. I feel better now.

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:11.860
I'm glad.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:17.440
You know, before he died, we were happy.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.730
I was uneasy, being married off
to someone I didn't know,

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:22.820
but somehow, we were a good match.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.400
In Siena, we lived happily, the two of us.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:33.190
But then, right after I got pregnant,
he got sick in the epidemic and died.

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:39.650
I want to live with this child
in the town we lived in together.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.570
Ruthanna...

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:44.610
But anyway, I was really surprised!

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:47.480
I couldn't believe Leo was working with someone.

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.690
Huh?

00:13:48.690 --> 00:13:51.610
Leo was always by himself.

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:55.070
Always covered in scrapes, like he'd been
fighting with the other apprentices,

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:58.030
he never opened up his heart to anyone.

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:03.860
He probably only talked to me
because I was his master's daughter.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:11.780
And now, I can't believe he's got such
a lovely young lady working for him.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:19.820
Seeing someone like you working next
to him gives me peace of mind.

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:23.940
Coming back to Florence, I thought
it'd be only unpleasant things,

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:27.030
but there were good things
like this waiting, too, huh?

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:29.230
Has that Ruthanna left yet?

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:34.440
To cause such a ruckus is disgraceful!
The neighbors are going to talk.

00:14:34.440 --> 00:14:38.940
We took her even though she was just an
artisan's daughter because of her large dowry,

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.860
but now my son is dead,

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:45.190
and she's insisting on her rights.
All she cares about is money!

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.190
You don't have to be so wary of me.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:52.480
What are you doing here?

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:56.570
There's no reason for you to keep coming
back to a small workshop like mine.

00:14:56.570 --> 00:14:58.690
I'll gladly welcome any work
you have for me, though.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:03.030
Unfortunately, there's a workshop we already
have a relationship with in Venice,

00:15:03.030 --> 00:15:05.400
so I'm not here to commission you.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:11.110
Oh, but... if you say you'll let me have your
apprentice in exchange for a commission,

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.570
then it'd be a different story.

00:15:14.650 --> 00:15:20.440
Is it really okay to just crush
her chance at being an artisan?

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:24.400
If it's about that, you should have already
heard directly from my apprentice.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:28.400
It's what she decided.
It isn't something for me to interfere with.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:32.110
I see, it's true...
She's the one who should decide.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.280
But you know, don't you?

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:39.360
How much artisans in the world
suffer in order to get jobs.

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:43.940
Polishing their conversation skills,
which have nothing to do with their craft,

00:15:43.940 --> 00:15:47.860
countless artisans flatter the rich
and are humiliated for their trouble.

00:15:47.860 --> 00:15:53.030
If you think about that, wasting
a chance like this is unthinkable.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:56.610
Leo, is there a possibility that you
gave her half-hearted advice

00:15:56.610 --> 00:16:00.070
because you didn't want to lose her?

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:01.860
Me?

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:06.150
Put your hand on your heart and think carefully.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:13.320
Thanks. It was delicious.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:19.610
The fortress wasn't very strong.
In fact, it seemed pretty weak.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:22.900
Let's see... Where should I attack from?

00:16:22.900 --> 00:16:27.110
Leo, I just got back.

00:16:28.190 --> 00:16:30.360
Leo?

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:33.320
Oh, you're back?

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:35.570
You're late. What happened?

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:37.400
I... I had some personal business...

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.230
I see. Be more careful next time.

00:16:40.230 --> 00:16:41.650
Huh?

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:44.360
Those cups--was someone here?

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:48.440
No, no one. Don't worry about it.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.070
Right...

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:55.110
To call this delicious is just flattery.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:17:00.860
It's not like I'd have any problems
if she weren't here...

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:09.610
We took her even though she was just an
artisan's daughter because of her large dowry,

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:11.440
but now my son is dead,

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:15.940
and she's insisting on her rights.
All she cares about is money!

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:17.610
Please!

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:22.780
I need money for this child in my
stomach, and also so I can live.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:31.110
Unfortunately, it's pretty common for widows
to get into disputes about money.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:35.400
There's nothing women with
no status or authority can do.

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:38.150
Does Ruthanna have any relatives
she can turn to?

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:41.480
Her father's already passed away... So, no...

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:45.860
I see... I could pull some strings
behind the scenes...

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:46.530
Huh?!

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:49.940
...but to use my customers
like that for a stranger...

00:17:49.940 --> 00:17:53.690
Th-Th-Th-There's no way I would ask that of you!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:56.360
Th-That's not why I came to you for advice!

00:17:56.360 --> 00:17:57.940
Oh, really?

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:04.530
But is there anyone you know with status
and authority who could act as a proxy?

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:07.400
Status and authority...?

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:11.530
Oh, there is!

00:18:11.530 --> 00:18:12.570
Huh?

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:15.730
There's someone who has
both status and authority!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:18.070
Someone who happens to be nearby!

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:21.730
I understand what you're saying.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:25.650
I didn't think she'd ended up
in such a bad situation...

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:31.400
I've already made the decision in my heart.
But there's one thing I'm worried about...

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.820
I wanted to ask you about it.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:35.980
Something you're worried about?

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:41.480
If I leave now, will you let me be
your apprentice again when I return?

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:50.940
Why are you going to such lengths for
Ruthanna's sake? Even if I ask that,

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.360
it's you we're talking about,
and you won't change your mind, right?

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.690
I-I'm sorr--

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.940
Under one condition.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:03.190
Take this job not as an independent artisan
but as a member of this workshop.

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:07.400
I'll be waiting here... as your master.

00:19:09.780 --> 00:19:11.440
Thank you very much!

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:15.070
Th-Then, I'll go tell him now!

00:19:15.070 --> 00:19:16.480
Arte!

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:21.360
Thanks for what you're doing for Ruthanna.

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:25.730
Sure!

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:29.610
I was just about to start putting
my own schemes into place...

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:32.280
I never thought you'd come to me on your own...

00:19:32.280 --> 00:19:32.980
Huh?

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:36.280
It's nothing. Just talking to myself.

00:19:36.280 --> 00:19:41.030
Well? Since you're here, it must mean
you've had a change of heart, right?

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:44.530
Yes. But I have a favor to ask of you.

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:52.150
Oh? In other words, you'd like me
to give that widow my support?

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:56.030
If that'll get you to come to
Venice, then it's a bargain.

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.570
We have a deal, then.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:02.230
Actually, there's one more thing...

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:07.030
I'd like to limit my time
in Venice to three months.

00:20:07.980 --> 00:20:10.530
Are you underestimating me?

00:20:10.530 --> 00:20:12.440
Huh? No, I'm not!

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.320
I-I'm being serious!

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:18.820
Once I finish my work in Venice,
I'd like to return here to Florence.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:23.360
I see. But I was hoping you'd
stay for at least a year...

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:28.480
Th-Then, what about six months for now?

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:34.320
Six months, huh? Depending on how you work,
it might need to be extended...

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:37.110
That's fine!

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:40.610
Really? Then, we have a deal.

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:45.230
It was decided, and so quickly.

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:48.570
U-Um, why did it have to be me?

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:54.070
Aren't there other people
who would make good tutors?

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:58.110
Hmm, let's see... Why you?

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:02.110
My niece and I have similar
personalities and sensibilities.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:06.230
For the most part, if I think something's
fun, she also thinks it's fun,

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:09.900
and things that I like, she likes, as well.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:11.440
In other words...

00:21:13.900 --> 00:21:18.570
It's because I like you.

00:21:18.570 --> 00:21:23.360
All of our important business partners
have said they'll stop doing business with us...

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:26.650
Us, too. What's happened all of a sudden?

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:26.650
"Gloom"

00:21:26.650 --> 00:21:29.730
What are you boys talking about?

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:32.530
I don't get it, either!

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:34.570
Nice to meet you.

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:38.780
Are you in need of assistance?

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:42.190
Thanks to you, I got my dowry back.

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:44.070
Thank you so much.

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:45.860
It was nothing!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.980
Please give birth to a healthy baby!

00:21:47.980 --> 00:21:49.190
Thanks.

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:53.110
Leo, I'm really glad I got to
see you again after so long.

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:55.650
Take care of yourself.

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:57.780
Be well, Ruthanna.

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:00.360
I will. You, too, Leo.

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.190
Arte.

00:22:05.190 --> 00:22:07.030
Take care of Leo for me.

00:22:07.030 --> 00:22:08.320
Huh?

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:15.440
Me... take care of Leo...?

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:17.980
Hey, we're going back.

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:19.940
Oh, okay!

00:23:56.070 --> 00:23:59.440
"Preview"

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:00.150
We won't be able to see each other for a while,
but keep doing your best to study, Darcia!

00:24:00.150 --> 00:24:02.730
Arte, do your best at work, too!

00:24:02.730 --> 00:24:05.900
There are things I'm worried about,
too, but I won't lose!

00:24:04.780 --> 00:24:04.880
"A New Chapter"

00:24:04.880 --> 00:24:11.050
"A New Chapter"

00:24:05.900 --> 00:24:07.650
Next time, "A New Chapter."

00:24:07.650 --> 00:24:11.030
I wonder what'll be waiting for me!
